ped remote-procedure-call system.", "role": "How internal services call each other efficiently with strict contracts.", "why": "Faster and stricter than REST for internal, high-volume service calls.", "pros": ["Fast binary protocol", "Typed contracts", "Streaming"], "cons": ["Not human-readable; extra tooling"]}, "istio": {"name": "Istio service mesh", "layer": "Worker fleet \u00b7 Go", "color": "#F2913D", "logo": "istio", "glyph": null, "what": "A service mesh that sits beside every service.", "role": "Adds mutual-TLS encryption and traffic control between services without app code.", "why": "Security and traffic-shaping handled by the platform, not each app.", "pros": ["mTLS everywhere", "Canary & retries at mesh level", "Free observability"], "cons": ["Adds complexity & overhead"]}, "claude": {"name": "Anthropic Claude API", "layer": "LLM providers", "color": "#EAB94C", "logo": "anthropic", "glyph": null, "what": "The large language model that powers the agents.", "role": "Does the actual reasoning and tool-use for every job (Messages API).", "why": "Strong tool-use, long context and reliable reasoning \u2014 ideal for agents.", "pros": ["Excellent tool-use & reasoning", "Long context window"], "cons": ["External cost & latency", "Provider rate limits"]}, "postgres": {"name": "PostgreSQL", "layer": "Storage plane \u00b7 polyglot", "color": "#3EB6A0", "logo": "postgresql", "glyph": null, "what": "A rock-solid relational (SQL) database.", "role": "The source of truth for jobs, tenants, quotas and the billing ledger.", "why": "ACID guarantees, decades of maturity, plus JSON and extensions when needed.", "pros": ["Reliable & consistent", "Extremely versatile"], "cons": ["Write-scaling needs planning"]}, "mongo": {"name": "MongoDB", "layer": "Storage plane \u00b7 polyglot", "color": "#3EB6A0", "logo": "mongodb", "glyph": null, "what": "A document (NoSQL) database.", "role": "Stores variable-shaped agent trajectories and payloads that don't fit tidy tables.", "why": "Flexible schema is perfect for deeply-nested, evolving agent data.", "pros": ["Flexible schema", "Fast document reads"], "cons": ["Weaker multi-document transactions"]}, "redis": {"name": "Redis", "layer": "Storage plane \u00b7 polyglot", "color": "#3EB6A0", "logo": "redis", "glyph": null, "what": "An in-memory data store.", "role": "Cache, hot state, and the counters behind rate-limiting and circuit-breaking.", "why": "Microsecond latency for the things that must be instant.", "pros": ["Blazing fast", "Very versatile"], "cons": ["Memory-bound", "Durability trade-offs"]}, "vector": {"name": "pgvector / Qdrant", "layer": "Storage plane \u00b7 polyglot", "color": "#3EB6A0", "logo": "qdrant", "glyph": null, "what": "A vector database for embeddings.", "role": "Stores the numeric 'meaning' of documents so RAG can find similar ones.", "why": "Enables semantic (meaning-based) search, not just keyword match.", "pros": ["Semantic similarity search"], "cons": ["Index tuning & memory cost"]}, "s3": {"name": "S3 / MinIO", "layer": "Storage plane \u00b7 polyglot", "color": "#3EB6A0", "logo": "minio", "glyph": null, "what": "Object storage (MinIO is S3-compatible, self-hosted).", "role": "Holds large artifacts and long-term archives cheaply.", "why": "Effectively infinite, durable and inexpensive for blobs.", "pros": ["Cheap, durable, scalable"], "cons": ["Higher latency than a DB"]}, "clickhouse": {"name": "ClickHouse", "layer": "Storage plane \u00b7 polyglot", "color": "#3EB6A0", "logo": "clickhouse", "glyph": null, "what": "A columnar OLAP (analytics) database.", "role": "The read-model / warehouse for fast analytics and dashboards.", "why": "Aggregates billions of rows in milliseconds \u2014 built for analytics.", "pros": ["Extremely fast analytics"], "cons": ["Not for transactional writes"]}, "k8s": {"name": "Kubernetes \u00b7 EKS + GKE", "layer": "Platform & runtime", "color": "#5C8AE0", "logo": "kubernetes", "glyph": null, "what": "The container orchestrator that runs the 