+      <div class="subtitle" style="max-width:660px;margin:10px auto 0">The concept companion to building <strong>Cosmos</strong> — an async, multi-tenant LLM job-orchestration platform that accepts jobs instantly, routes them to healthy providers under rate limits, and processes them resiliently with full state history and observability. These notes scale a five-endpoint CRUD app into that production-grade, cloud-native system — teaching distributed systems, resilience, data-at-scale and architect-level design across 13 buildable stages (Foundations 0.5 → Stage 12).</div>
